ext":"You: Excuse me, could you tell me the way to the hospital?  —  শুনুন, হাসপাতালে যাওয়ার রাস্তাটা বলবেন?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Local: Sure. Go straight for two blocks.  —  অবশ্যই। দুই ব্লক সোজা যান।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Local: Then turn right at the traffic light.  —  তারপর ট্রাফিক লাইটে ডানে ঘুরুন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Is it far from here?  —  এখান থেকে কি দূরে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Local: No, it is about ten minutes on foot.  —  না, হেঁটে প্রায় দশ মিনিট।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Thank you so much. I''ll find it.  —  অনেক ধন্যবাদ। আমি পেয়ে যাব।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Local: You''re welcome. You can''t miss it — it''s a big white building.  —  স্বাগতম। মিস করবেন না — এটা একটা বড় সাদা বিল্ডিং।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ২ — একটা জায়গা বর্ণনা করা"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"English"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বাংলা"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"It is a busy city with lots of traffic."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এটা একটা ব্যস্ত শহর, প্রচুর যানজট থাকে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"It is a quiet and peaceful village."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এটা একটা শান্ত ও নিরিবিলি গ্রাম।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","conten